<title>USA: Battery Park City $79.4 mln revs repriced.</title>
<headline>Battery Park City $79.4 mln revs repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said it repriced $79.4 million of Battery Park City Authority junior revenue bonds, Series 1996A, cutting the yield in 2029 to 5.83 percent from 5.875 percent.</p>
<p>BATTERY PARK CITY AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $79,425,000*</p>
<p>JUNIOR REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1996A</p>
<p>	   --WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa - AMBAC	 S&amp;P: AAA - AMBAC</p>
<p>DATED: 09/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 05/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
